<custom_item>
  type        : CMD_EXEC
  description : "089, Wireless e bluetooth ausentes, Média"
  info        : "Executa o comando do audit para validar Wireless e bluetooth ausentes. Saída conforme quando atende `(?i)^\\s*pass\\s*$`. Validar conforme a função, a arquitetura e as exceções aprovadas para o servidor."
  solution    : "Ajustar o controle 'Wireless e bluetooth ausentes' conforme a política aprovada para Debian-like 11+."
  reference   : "03_Hardening_2026_DEBLIKE.xlsx"
  see_also    : "03_Hardening_2026_DEBLIKE.xlsx"
  cmd         : "if find /sys/class/net -maxdepth 2 -type d -path '*/wireless' -print -quit 2>/dev/null | grep -q . || for u in bluetooth.service; do systemctl list-unit-files \"$u\" --no-legend 2>/dev/null | grep -q . && exit 0; done; exit 1; then if find /sys/class/net -maxdepth 2 -type d -path '*/wireless' -print -quit 2>/dev/null | grep -q . || for u in bluetooth.service; do systemctl list-unit-files \"$u\" --no-legend 2>/dev/null | grep -q . && exit 0; done; exit 1; then if find /sys/class/net -maxdepth 2 -type d -path '*/wireless' -print -quit 2>/dev/null | grep -q . || for u in bluetooth.service; do systemctl list-unit-files \"$u\" --no-legend 2>/dev/null | grep -q . && exit 0; done; exit 1; then ( ! find /sys/class/net -maxdepth 2 -type d -path '*/wireless' -print -quit 2>/dev/null | grep -q . && ! systemctl is-active --quiet bluetooth.service 2>/dev/null ) && echo PASS || echo FAIL; else echo NA; fi; else echo NA; fi; else echo NA; fi"
  expect      : "(?i)^\\s*(PASS|NA)\\s*$"
</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type        : CMD_EXEC
  description : "090, Permissões do SSH, Alta"
  info        : "Valida configuração SSH para Permissões do SSH. Saída conforme quando atende `^(600|640) root root \\| (700|750) root root$`."
  solution    : "Aplicar em /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-hardening.conf, validar com sshd -t e sshd -T e recarregar ssh somente com sessão de contingencia."
  reference   : "03_Hardening_2026_DEBLIKE.xlsx"
  see_also    : "03_Hardening_2026_DEBLIKE.xlsx"
  cmd         : "if command -v sshd >/dev/null 2>&1 && [ -f /etc/ssh/sshd_config ]; then if command -v sshd >/dev/null 2>&1 && [ -f /etc/ssh/sshd_config ]; then if command -v sshd >/dev/null 2>&1 && [ -f /etc/ssh/sshd_config ]; then ( stat -Lc '%a %u %g' /etc/ssh/sshd_config 2>/dev/null | grep -Eq '^(600|640|644) 0 0$' && stat -Lc '%a %u %g' /etc/ssh 2>/dev/null | grep -Eq '^(700|750|755) 0 0$' && ! find /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d -type f -perm /022 -print -quit 2>/dev/null | grep -q . ) && echo PASS || echo FAIL; else echo NA; fi; else echo NA; fi; else echo NA; fi"
  expect      : "(?i)^\\s*(PASS|NA)\\s*$"
</custom_item>

